{"id":"n65609-1-12","stage":4,"title":"승승장구 · 乘胜长驱","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65609-1-12-1","ko":"내일 경기만 이기면 이제 준결승전이야.","zh":"只要明天赢了这场比赛，我们就进半决赛了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"경기만","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기만","audio":"/audio/f775505f854876ea3465.mp3"}},{"text":"이기면","meaning":"赢，战胜，打败","explanation":"이기다：赢，战胜，打败；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"이기다","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71688","senseId":"1","lemma":"이기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이기면","audio":"/audio/99b2b669e40e1424ced0.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"준결승전이야.","meaning":"半决赛","explanation":"준결승전：半决赛；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"준결승전","audio":"/audio/1e030ece0e2ad712725d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76718","senseId":"1","lemma":"준결승전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준결승전이야","audio":"/audio/e337cde0abaa4185eefb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"e5